# HR Contract Generation – Walkthrough

## What was built
A feature to generate and print 3 types of HR contracts for fulltime employees directly from the app, using existing employee and salary data.

### New Files
- [contractService.ts](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/hr/services/contractService.ts) – HTML template generators for HĐLĐ, HĐTV, and NDA contracts
- [ContractGenerator.tsx](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/hr/components/ContractGenerator.tsx) – Full-screen modal with contract type selector, preview, and print

### Modified Files
- [EmployeeDetail.tsx](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/hr/components/EmployeeDetail.tsx) – Added "📝 Xuất hợp đồng" button (fulltime only)

