## Key Design Decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|---|---|
| HTML + `window.print()` instead of jsPDF | Vietnamese diacritics render perfectly with system fonts; no 500KB+ font embedding needed |
| Inline iframe preview | Real-time preview as user changes contract type, number, or signing date |
| Employee data validation panel | Shows ⚠️ warnings for missing fields (CMND, address, etc.) so HR can fix before printing |

## Data Flow
1. User clicks **"📝 Xuất hợp đồng"** on a fulltime employee detail page
2. Modal loads salary components from Supabase (`hr_employee_salary` + `hr_salary_components`)
3. User selects contract type, enters contract number and signing date
4. HTML template is generated with employee + salary data filled in
5. Preview renders in iframe; clicking **"🖨️ In / Xuất PDF"** opens browser print dialog (Save as PDF)

## Content Integrity
> [!IMPORTANT]
> All contract text content is **100% preserved** from the original PDF templates. Only formatting (CSS styling, page layout) was improved for a more professional look.

